  "id": "ismip/ismip7-ais-forcing",
  "title": "ISMIP7 Antarctic Ice Sheet Forcing",
  "description": "Atmospheric and oceanic forcing dataset for Antarctic ice sheet models, prepared for the ISMIP7 project. It includes downscaled outputs from the CESM2-WACCM and MRI-ESM2-0 climate models under control, historical, and multiple SSP emissions scenarios at 2 km and 8 km resolution using three downscaling methods, along with ocean forcing, reanalysis-driven forcing, fracture fields, and ISMIP7 grid definitions.",
